  "narrative": {
    "text": "Figure 1 — a JSON Schema rendered as a class diagram, generated from the natural-language prompt quoted beside it. Four boxes: `root` holding `experiments: object[]`; an `experiments entry` with `metal_salt: metalSalt`, `ligand: ligand`, `creator`, `date`, `temperature`, `duration` and `product_purity: boolean`; and TWO separate leaf definitions, `metalSalt` and `ligand`, each carrying an identical `name`/`mass`/`inchi` triple. That duplication is the point of the figure — it is what the next prompt asks to be removed.",
